            "content": {
              "type": "code_execution_result",
              "stdout": "<class 'str'>\n[{\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Best International Schools in Bangkok: 2026 Guide for Expat Families\", \"url\": \"https://www.ischooladvisor.com/articles/schooling-and-school-choice/guide-to-choosing-a-school/best-international-schools-bangkok-2026-guide\", \"content\": \"**It is a particularly strong choice for families from North America**. \\u2026 NIST International School and International School Bangkok (ISB) are consistently ranked among Bangkok's top international schools.\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Bangkok: 2026 Guide for Expat Families\\n## Top International Schools in Bangkok for 2026\\n### NIST International School\\nNIST International School is Bangkok's leading IB World School, offering the full IB continuum from PYP through MYP to the IB Diploma. Located in Sukhumvit, it is ideally situated for families based in Bangkok's central business and residential districts. NIST is known for its strong academic results, diverse international community, and outstanding co-curricular programme \\u2014 particularly in arts and sport. It is consistently ranked among Asia's top international schools.\\n\\n### International School Bangkok (ISB)\\nInternational School Bangkok is one of Thailand's oldest and most prestigious international schools, founded in 1951.\\n\\nIt is a particularly strong choice for families from North America.\\n\\n### KIS International School Reignwood Park\\nKIS International School Reignwood Park is a well-regarded IB World School located in northern Bangkok.\\n\\nIt is a popular choice for families seeking a smaller, more intimate international school environment.\\n\\n### What is the best international school in Bangkok?\\nNIST International School and International School Bangkok (ISB) are consistently ranked among Bangkok's top international schools. NIST excels in the IB pathway while ISB is the leading choice for families following an American curriculum.\", \"page_age\": \"24 days ago\"}, {\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Garden International School Bangkok\", \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garden_International_School_Bangkok\", \"content\": \"- 2 Akart Yen Akat Road, Thung Maha Mek, Sathon, Bangkok 10120, Thailand Thailand\\n\\n- Type: Private international school\\n\\n- Accreditation: Edu Development Trust, Cambridge Assessment International Education\\n\\nGarden International School Bangkok (\\n\\nGarden International School Bangkok was founded in 1999 to provide a British-style education to both expatriate and local families in Bangkok.\\n\\nGarden International School Bangkok is accredited by the Edu Development Trust and authorized to offer Cambridge International Examinations.\\n[[7]](./Garden_International_School_Bangkok#cite_note-7) The school is a member of the [Federation of British International Schools in Asia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federation_of_British_International_Schools_in_Asia) (FOBISIA).\\n\\nAs of 2025, the school enrolls approximately 390 students representing over 40 nationalities.\\n\\nRetrieved 2025-\n",
